    "body": "> An alternative to this PR is \"keep the current spec, just do not care about error object identity\".\r\n\r\nI don't think that's a viable alternative. We can't have behavior in the spec we don't care about.\r\n\r\nI think we need to get something interoperable, and this spec PR was my proposal for doing so.",
